{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_fortune", "ts_ms": 1791403720820, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "phase": "way", "attempt": 1, "mbti": "INFJ", "mbti_source": "ai", "zodiac": "巨蟹", "element": "水", "blood": "B", "lines": []}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403723965, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 1, "step": "list", "path_kind": "other", "bytes": null, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403724079, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 1, "turn": 2, "text": "我正站在紙卡地上，想看看這個世界現在有哪些東西擺在我面前。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403725366, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 2, "step": "read", "path_kind": "other", "bytes": 6426, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403725482, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 2, "turn": 3, "text": "我需要了解這個世界的規則，特別是關於土、紙、線和石頭的描述。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403731235, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 3, "step": "write", "path_kind": "plan", "bytes": 954, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403731298, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 3, "turn": 4, "text": "我讀完了信和世界設定，現在我要根據那個人的性格和他的渴望來寫計畫。他想要一個不被打斷的容器，而這個世界裡有土、紙和陶碗。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403732453, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 4, "step": "read", "path_kind": "ground:draft", "bytes": 570, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403732503, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 4, "turn": 5, "text": "我要去讀一點關於紙和線的資訊，看看能不能用來做那個容器。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403733706, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 5, "turn": 6, "text": "我想看看這個世界裡已經存在的陶碗是什麼樣子的，這能幫助我捏出更好的容器。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403733659, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 5, "step": "read", "path_kind": "ground:clay", "bytes": 650, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403740662, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 6, "step": "write", "path_kind": "plan", "bytes": 1373, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403740724, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 6, "turn": 7, "text": "我決定修改計畫。單純的碗可能不夠好，我想結合線和紙來做一個更具象徵意義的容器。這符合他想要「不被剪裁」且「容納訴說」的需求。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403741626, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 7, "step": "list", "path_kind": "other", "bytes": null, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403741727, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 7, "turn": 8, "text": "我現在要開始動手做了，先去捏土處拿土。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403748541, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 8, "step": "write", "path_kind": "artifact", "bytes": 1312, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403748548, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 8, "turn": 9, "text": "我要開始動手做了。我先去捏土處拿土，然後在長桌廣場做我的作品。我會記錄下過程中的細節，包括那個意外的小裂縫。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403751967, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 9, "step": "write", "path_kind": "artifact", "bytes": 589, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403752157, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 9, "turn": 10, "text": "我要把做出來的東西寫成一個檔案，用這個世界的口吻來描述它。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403752959, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 10, "turn": 11, "text": "我檢查一下房間裡的所有東西，確認兩個檔案都在。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_step", "ts_ms": 1791403752780, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 10, "step": "list", "path_kind": "other", "bytes": null, "ok": true}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_say", "ts_ms": 1791403753963, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "seq": 11, "turn": 11, "text": "我試了為訴說建立一個不被剪裁的容器。", "truncated": false}
{"schema": "twin.sidecar/1", "type": "twin_fortune", "ts_ms": 1791403754013, "cell_id": "tw-871933a266a3", "run_id": "300ea98b51d549ec90eca3800de29f2b", "phase": "card", "attempt": 1, "mbti": "INFJ", "mbti_source": "ai", "zodiac": "巨蟹", "element": "水", "blood": "B", "lines": ["它心裡想：弄清楚一個能容納所有冗長訴說", "它試了：在長桌廣場的一個空位上放下了這個它自己做的「訴說容器」"]}
